1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,810
You are in the middle of a shopping mall when emergency sirens scream.

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,440
A nuclear detonation in under sixty seconds.

3
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:12,510
Most people run to the parking lot and get incinerated in traffic.

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:16,900
Your actual survival ticket? Run downward.

5
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:22,810
A modern mall basement is reinforced with thousands of tons of concrete and earth,

6
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:26,240
creating an impromptu radiation fortress.

7
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:31,470
The instant the flash hits: drop flat against an interior support pillar,

8
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:35,380
face down, hands over your head, and open your mouth.

9
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:41,290
Keeping your mouth open equalizes blast overpressure, saving your lungs and eardrums.

10
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:46,280
You survived the shockwave. But the real countdown has just begun.
